  data: {
    LLM: "Get your initial 30-point meld down early so you can manipulate the table; use jokers in runs or groups you can later reclaim with the real tile.\n\nBreak and recombine opponents' melds when it lets you play more tiles; keep runs and groups balanced so you can add from hand without getting stuck.\n\nPlan table rearrangements before touching tiles; use time limits to pressure opponents; when pool is low, prefer melding over drawing to reduce others' options.",
